{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_02",
  "title": "首轮竞赛",
  "storyCode": "DH-2",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1ead3f610a34bbd792f1962290176bc6df44b370c026791f8193aa5591c11444",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "亲爱的观众们，万众期待的第八届多索雷斯极限铁人大奖赛，即将正式开幕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在开幕前，让我们有请我们敬爱的坎黛拉市长发表开幕词。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "市民们，游客们，欢迎来到我引以为豪的城市，多索雷斯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "无论你来自哪里，无论你有着怎么样的过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "既然你能够来到这座城市，那就都放下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "享受这座城市带给你的一切，享受你应该享受的一切吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "高兴起来，欢笑起来，尖叫起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这里是我为你们所有人打造的乐园！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "来吧，在这里收获你们一生中最难忘的时光吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好的，非常感谢坎黛拉市长一如既往点燃激情的开幕词，那么，接下来，我们来介绍各位参赛选手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "今年依旧有不少熟面孔，而且新面孔也不少！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "首先，看起来是一对恩爱情侣，实际上也是一对恩爱情侣，但是战斗力却十分高的队伍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "甜蜜夏日队！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的男游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是爱的力量让我们相遇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "懒散的女游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是爱的力量让我们相爱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男游客&女游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们两个人爱的力量，是无敌的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "爱的力量如此闪耀，连我都要眩晕过去了！让我们拭目以待爱的力量能够走多远吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "然后是单人成队，来自大胃王海选的出线选手，水月！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "外表人畜无害，却吃掉了我们一家餐厅仓库存量的食物，拥有着无底的胃袋以及与这片海洋相得益彰的蓝色头发。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "吃豆人队！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈喽哈喽，大家好呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "水月选手，有什么振奋人心的参赛宣言吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯......玩腻了就把你们都吃掉哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "噢噢噢，水月选手，用最平淡的口吻说出了最恐怖的话，让我们期待他的活跃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "接下来，是由本地人组成的队，队长拉菲艾拉小姐虽然外表可爱，却拿着一把凶恶大镰，这种反差正是这支队伍的一大看点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "让我们欢迎——灰羽队！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大家好哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "拉菲艾拉小姐，你的参赛宣言是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯......我会努力的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯嗯，好的，好的，有的时候，朴实无华才最动人！灰羽队，我很看好你们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "紧接着，是本次比赛的新面孔，却也是最受瞩目的一队！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "中途插入混战海选，以无人能敌的姿态获胜，得到了潘乔先生青睐的超新星。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "由两位来自双日城友好城市——龙门的女侠，林雨霞小姐，陈晖洁小姐，以及本地的武器店老板，埃内斯托先生组成的队伍————"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "————鼠胆龙威队！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "又强又新的队伍总是让人欲罢不能，他们的赔率相当高，但是，你真的敢对他们下注吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那么，请队长发表一下参赛宣言吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "谁是队长？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "埃内斯托，你来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "反正林雨霞不可能听我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你也不可能听我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呃，好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那么，我们的参赛宣言是——在这场比赛的历史上刻下属于我们的痕迹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么样，二位？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一般。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "确实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我想也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "非常霸气的宣言！让我们期待鼠胆龙威队的精彩表现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "然后，接下来的队伍是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂，Missy，这边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "来了！喂，别挤，我的冰淇淋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真是，人也太多了吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "说明这场比赛万众瞩目啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "比起这个，你快看，老陈居然拿着跟铳差不多的玩意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看来她这次是不打算用剑了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她这不是作茧自缚吗，她射击训练成绩也就和我差不多吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哇，你不要把优秀说得和不要钱一样好不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她剑术可不止是优秀的水平。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎，Missy，我发现，你只要不当着老陈的面，夸起她来比我还过分啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我只是在陈述事实好不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是是。不过，比起这个，老陈用剑以外的武器，这可是珍贵影像啊。等下去问问主办方能不能要一份比赛录像好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别去了，丢死人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这有什么丢人的，到时候剪成一部片，我名字都想好了，就叫《老陈用铳大显神威》。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我发现你说不定有导演烂片的天赋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "过奖过奖。对了，Missy，跟您商量个事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别啊，我还没说什么事呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你一说您，我刚吃下去的冰淇淋都差点吐出来，你用这种语气求人的时候肯定没好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎，不是，就，我看到他们官方有一个面向观众的节目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我看了看，可以猜谁会赢，还有很多小项目，比如谁最先抢到金块，谁第一个出局什么的，就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你这个猜字用得可真是精髓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这可是官方项目，正规合法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘁，这座城市里干什么违法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......这你倒是也没说错，不过我们现在毕竟只是旅客，管不了那么多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而且你看，虽然你是想看老陈她们笑话，但是万一她们要是赢了，我们也不亏对不对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "双赢啊，Missy。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......唉，算了，卡给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "多谢诗大小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别乱花啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "得嘞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那么，以上就是全部四十支参赛队伍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "比赛将全程用摄像头和无人机跟踪拍摄，力求让观众们不错过任何一个精彩的镜头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "并且，除了这个主舞台之外，官方还分设了十个分舞台并配备了专门的主持人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "希望能在不错过精彩镜头的基础上为各位观众带去同样精彩的解说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "另外，在开幕式开始的时间点，为了让观众们也享受到参与比赛的乐趣，我们为观众们也准备了丰富多彩的竞猜项目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "各位观众在官方网站上登录自己的信息后可以为自己赚一笔外快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "具体操作流程请参照官方发布的比赛指南。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那么，各位参赛选手现在已经在我们的出发区域准备就绪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "第一轮比赛，将在被划分好的区域中进行赤金的寻找与争夺，获得赤金的队伍可以直接交付给终点的工作人员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是，也可以尝试夺取更多的赤金，因为，获得的赤金就是属于他们的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那么，请坎黛拉市长拉响代表比赛开始的礼炮吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我宣布——第一轮比赛，正式开始！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "分头行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
